1
00:05:17,647 --> 00:05:23,647
Gallowwalkers is a action, horror, western film directed by Andrew Goth.

2
00:10:35,294 --> 00:10:41,294
When a nun broke her covenant with God to save the life of 
her unborn son, Aman, he was cursed for life.

3
00:15:52,941 --> 00:15:58,941
As an adult, Aman has killed those who have crossed him.

4
00:21:10,588 --> 00:21:16,588
But his curse brings his victims back to life and they pursue him for revenge, so Aman
enlists a young gunman to fight by his side against his undead victims.

5
00:26:28,235 --> 00:26:34,235
Aman, played by Wesley Snipes.

6
00:31:45,882 --> 00:31:51,882
Fabulos, played by Riley Smith.

7
00:37:03,529 --> 00:37:09,529
Angel, played by Tanit Phoenix.

8
00:42:21,176 --> 00:42:27,176
Apollo Jones, played by Steven Elder.

9
00:47:38,823 --> 00:47:44,823
Mistress, played by Jenny Gago.

10
00:52:56,470 --> 00:53:02,470
Kansa, played by Kevin Howarth.

11
00:58:14,117 --> 00:58:20,117
Gallowwalkers is a 2012 American Western horror film written and directed by Andrew Goth, and starring Wesley
Snipes, Kevin Howarth, Riley Smith, Tanit Phoenix, Patrick Bergin, and Diamond Dallas Page.

12
01:03:31,764 --> 01:03:37,764
Due to Wesley Snipes' tax problems, the film went through many
changes and delays and was completed in 2010.

13
01:08:49,411 --> 01:08:55,411
It still had no official release until a 2012 screening at the
"Film4 FrightFest" festival in the United Kingdom.

14
01:14:07,058 --> 01:14:13,058
It was released on DVD and Blu-ray in the United States in 2013, nearly
eight years after the film started production in 2006.

15
01:19:24,705 --> 01:19:30,705
The film explores themes of nun, hair, zombie, skin, gunman.

16
01:24:42,352 --> 01:24:48,352
The tone is dark.
